OL,3,GNEWSARed light jumping cyclists offered
OL,4,Afilm over fine
OL,5,
OL,6,FCyclists caught riding through red
OL,7,Flights in the Square Mile will now be
OL,8,Fgiven the chance to watch a
OL,9,F"hard-hitting road safety film" rather
OL,10,Fthan face an immediate fine.
OL,12,FCity of London Police hopes its "STOP,
OL,13,FLOOK, LISTEN, CHANGE" initiative will
OL,14,Ftackle dangerous riding through
OL,15,Feducation by having cyclists watch a
OL,16,Fshort film showcasing the consequences
OL,17,Fof jumping red lights.
OL,19,FThe force said officers would retain
OL,20,Ffull discretion during patrols, and
OL,21,Ffines would still be issued where
OL,22,Fdeemed necessary.
OL,23,APub: 14-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
