OL,3,GNEWSARed light jumping cyclists offered
OL,4,Afilm over fine
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt comes as figures reveal the force
OL,7,Fissued 1,315 fixed penalty notices to
OL,8,Fcyclists during 2025/26 - more than
OL,9,Fdouble the 643 handed out during the
OL,10,Fprevious financial year.
